---
import Demo from '../components/Demo';
import { Mascot } from '../components/Mascot';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>Swaprika</title>
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="A GraphQL API for context aware ingredient substitution. What can replace this ingredient, in this situation, and what changes if you do."
    />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="nav">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <span class="brand-mark"><Mascot client:load mood="idle" size={30} /></span>
        <span>Swaprika</span>
      </a>
      <nav>
        <a href="/graphql">Playground</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/n3ndor/swaprika">GitHub</a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="hero-copy">
          <h1>Butter in a cake is not<br /> butter in a croissant.</h1>
          <p class="lede">
            Every food API can tell you butter can be replaced by coconut oil. None of
            them tell you it will ruin your lamination, that you have to put the water
            back when you swap in oil, or what you give up when you do.
          </p>
          <p class="lede">
            Swaprika is a GraphQL API where the substitution is a fact about
            a <em>context</em>, not a link between two ingredients.
          </p>
          <div class="cta">
            <a class="btn primary" href="#demo">Try it below</a>
            <a class="btn" href="/graphql">Open the playground</a>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hero-art">
          <Mascot client:load mood="idle" size={230} />
        </div>
      </section>

      <section id="demo" class="demo-section">
        <h2>Change the situation. Watch the answer change.</h2>
        <p class="sub">
          Pick a croissant and you will get nothing back, because no vegan fat here has
          been verified to survive lamination. That empty result is the product.
        </p>
        <Demo client:visible />
      </section>

      <section class="why">
        <h2>Why the data sits on the edge</h2>
        <div class="why-grid">
          <div>
            <h3>A pair is not a fact</h3>
            <p>
              Buttermilk to milk plus acid appears twice in the data. Once as a leavening
              reagent for pancakes, once as a tenderiser in a chicken brine. Same two
              ingredients, different job, different failure mode.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>What it loses is the useful half</h3>
            <p>
              Swap butter for oil and you keep the fat but lose the creamed air and the
              water. The API says so, and tells you to put about fifteen percent of the
              butter weight back as liquid.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>The price list is the schema</h3>
            <p>
              Paid fields are declared on the field with an auth scope. A free key
              resolves the ratio and the roles, and gets an explicit authorization error
              for the rest. Flip the toggle above and watch it happen.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>No substitution chains</h3>
            <p>
              Substitutability does not compose. Butter to coconut oil to avocado oil to
              olive oil is a pretty graph query that returns culinary nonsense, so it
              does not exist here. Recursion lives on the taxonomy instead.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>
        Code MIT. Substitution data CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, commercial licence available.
        Built by <a href="https://github.com/n3ndor">Nandor Nagy</a>.
      </p>
    </footer>

    <style is:global>
      :root {
        --bg: #14100f;
        --panel: #1d1817;
        --panel-2: #241e1c;
        --line: #392f2c;
        --text: #f2e9e6;
        --muted: #a2908a;
        --red: #e04a34;
        --green: #5aa64c;
        --amber: #e0a33a;
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        background: var(--bg);
        color: var(--text);
        font: 16px/1.6 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      }
      a { color: inherit; }
      h1, h2, h3 { line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 0 0 0.5em; }
      code, pre { font-family: ui-monospace, "SF Mono", Menlo, Consolas, monospace; }

      .nav {
        display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
        padding: 16px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        position: sticky; top: 0; background: rgba(20,16,15,0.85);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px); z-index: 10;
      }
      .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-weight: 650; text-decoration: none; }
      .brand-mark { display: block; width: 30px; height: 34px; }
      .nav nav { display: flex; gap: 20px; }
      .nav nav a { color: var(--muted); text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px; }
      .nav nav a:hover { color: var(--text); }

      main { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 24px; }

      .hero {
        display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 1fr; gap: 40px;
        align-items: center; padding: 72px 0 56px;
      }
      .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(32px, 5.2vw, 56px); }
      .lede { color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; max-width: 54ch; }
      .lede em { color: var(--text); font-style: normal; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--red); }
      .hero-art { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
      .cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; margin-top: 28px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .btn {
        display: inline-block; padding: 11px 20px; border-radius: 10px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line); text-decoration: none; font-size: 15px;
        transition: transform .15s ease, background .15s ease;
      }
      .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); background: var(--panel-2); }
      .btn.primary { background: var(--red); border-color: var(--red); font-weight: 600; }

      section { padding: 56px 0; }
      section > h2 { font-size: clamp(24px, 3.4vw, 34px); }
      .sub { color: var(--muted); max-width: 66ch; margin-top: -4px; }

      /* demo */
      .demo { position: relative; margin-top: 28px; }
      .demo-controls {
        background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px;
      }
      .sentence { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: clamp(18px, 2.6vw, 26px); }
      .sentence select {
        background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--text); border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 9px; padding: 7px 12px; font-size: inherit; font-family: inherit;
        cursor: pointer;
      }
      .toggles { display: flex; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 18px; align-items: center; }
      .chip, .seg {
        background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--muted); border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 15px; cursor: pointer; font-size: 14px;
        font-family: inherit; transition: all .15s ease;
      }
      .chip.on { background: var(--green); border-color: var(--green); color: #0d1a0b; font-weight: 600; }
      .plan-switch { display: flex; gap: 6px; margin-left: auto; }
      .seg.on { background: var(--red); border-color: var(--red); color: #fff; font-weight: 600; }
      .plan-note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin: 14px 0 0; }

      .demo-body { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.15fr; gap: 18px; margin-top: 18px; }
      .panel-label {
        text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.09em; font-size: 11px;
        color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 10px;
      }
      .demo-query {
        background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px;
      }
      .demo-query pre { margin: 0; overflow-x: auto; }
      .demo-query code { font-size: 12.5px; line-height: 1.65; color: #cbb8b2; white-space: pre; }

      .demo-results { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; }
      .card {
        background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 14px; padding: 16px 18px;
      }
      .card header { display: flex; align-items: baseline; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; }
      .card h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 18px; }
      .ratio { color: var(--amber); font-size: 13px; font-family: ui-monospace, monospace; white-space: nowrap; }
      .note { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin: 8px 0 0; }
      .roles { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 6px; margin-top: 12px; }
      .tag { font-size: 11.5px; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 999px; border: 1px solid; }
      .tag.keeps { color: var(--green); border-color: #2f5e27; background: #16240f; }
      .tag.loses { color: #ef8a78; border-color: #5e2f27; background: #26110f; }
      .effect, .adjust { font-size: 13.5px; margin: 10px 0 0; color: #d9c8c3; }
      .adjust { color: var(--amber); }
      .locked {
        margin-top: 12px; padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 9px;
        border: 1px dashed var(--line); color: var(--muted); font-size: 12.5px;
      }
      .rel {
        display: inline-block; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: .06em;
        text-transform: uppercase; padding: 3px 9px; border-radius: 6px;
        background: var(--panel-2); color: var(--muted);
      }
      .rel.established { color: var(--green); }
      .rel.contested { color: #ef8a78; }

      .empty {
        display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; text-align: center;
        gap: 6px; padding: 28px 20px; background: var(--panel);
        border: 1px dashed var(--line); border-radius: 14px;
      }
      .empty p { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 16px; }
      .empty small { color: var(--muted); max-width: 40ch; }

      .demo-mascot { position: absolute; right: -10px; top: -96px; pointer-events: none; }

      .why-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 26px; margin-top: 26px; }
      .why-grid h3 { font-size: 17px; color: var(--red); }
      .why-grid p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; margin: 0; }

      footer {
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line); margin-top: 40px; padding: 26px 24px;
        color: var(--muted); font-size: 13.5px; text-align: center;
      }

      @media (max-width: 860px) {
        .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-top: 40px; }
        .hero-art { order: -1; }
        .demo-body { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .why-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        .demo-mascot { display: none; }
        .plan-switch { margin-left: 0; }
      }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        * { animation-duration: .01ms !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
      }
    </style>
  </body>
</html>
